        "en": "Suzhou Museum, Main Museum"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh-Hans": "苏州博物馆本馆的新馆建筑由贝聿铭设计，于2006年开放。庭院将池塘、假山、小桥等园林元素融入博物馆空间。",
        "en": "Designed by I. M. Pei and opened in 2006, the main museum’s newer building brings garden elements such as a pond, rockwork and bridges into the museum."
